sequenceDiagram

Actor Request
Participant nss-handler
Participant json-server
Participant Views
Participant Docks
Participant Haulers
Participant Ships
Participant Db

json-server ->> nss-handler: give me your exports

nss-handler -->> json-server: here you go

json-server ->> Views: give me your exports

    Views ->> Docks: Give me your exports
    Docks -->> Views: Here you go

    Views ->> Haulers: Give me your exports
    Haulers -->> Views: here you go

    Views ->> Ships: Give me your exports
    Ships -->> Views: here you go

Views -->> json-server: here you go



Request ->> json-server: makes a get request

    json-server ->> nss-handler: parse_url for me

    nss-handler -->> json-server: here is the parsed url  as dictionary

    Loop json-server
        Note over json-server: checks if it requests <br> a hauler, dock or ship
    End

    Note right of json-server: if ships

    json-server ->> Views: call retrieve_ship()

        Views ->> Ships: call retrieve_ship()

            Ships ->> Db: here is a db query

            Db -->> Ships: here is a response

            loop
                note over Ships: loops over db results <br> and adds them to a list
            end

        Ships -->> Views: response
    
    Views -->> json-server: response

    json-server ->> nss-handler: get response code and body

    nss-handler -->> json-server: here it is

json-server -->> Request: response


Request ->> json-server: makes a PUT request
    
    json-server ->> nss-handler: parse_url for me

    nss-handler -->> json-server: here is the parsed url  as dictionary

    Loop json-server
        Note over json-server: checks if it requests <br> a hauler, dock or ship
    End

    Note right of json-server: if hauler

    json-server ->> Views: call update_hauler()

        Views ->> Haulers: call update_hauler()

            Haulers ->> Db: here is a db query

            Db -->> Haulers: here is a response

        Haulers -->> Views: response
    
    Views -->> json-server: response

    json-server ->> nss-handler: get response code and body

    nss-handler -->> json-server: here it is

json-server -->> Request: response



