    json-server ->> nss-handler: parse_url for me

    nss-handler -->> json-server: here is the parsed url  as dictionary

    Loop json-server
        Note over json-server: checks if it requests <br> a hauler, dock or ship
    End

    Note right of json-server: if dock

    json-server ->> Views: call delete_dock()

        Views ->> Docks: call delete_dock()

            Docks ->> Db: here is a db query

            Db -->> Docks: here is a response

        Docks -->> Views: response
    
    Views -->> json-server: response

    json-server ->> nss-handler: get response code and body

    nss-handler -->> json-server: here it is

